{"unit_id":"ILVACM__DSH-Deveco2API#card-zh","repo":"ILVACM/DSH-Deveco2API","commit":"0cd0e935e5e5af02d3e32858f4c153a16b8690c8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deveco2api 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型接入插件，将 DevEco Code 的内置模型作为 DSH 的原生 LlmAdapter 提供方。它复用本机已登录的 DevEco CLI 凭据，动态获取可用模型目录，并以流式方式发送对话、转换响应事件；同时提供模型列表与上下文状态页面，可刷新目录、探测上下文容量或立即压缩。适合希望在 DSH 中使用 DevEco 内置模型并查看上下文状态的用户。需要已登录的 DevEco CLI 华为账号，并连接华为 DevEco 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/plugin/src/index.ts:108-119","packages/plugin/src/adapter/deveco-adapter.ts:143-210","packages/plugin/src/client/CapacityCard.tsx:66-89","packages/plugin/src/auth/store.ts:49-96","packages/plugin/src/adapter/wire.ts:57-70"]}
